{
  "version": "2.17",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "JnygO",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Brief · Descubrir",
      "width": 360,
      "fill": "$bg-muted",
      "cornerRadius": "$radius-md",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": "$space-4",
      "padding": "$space-5",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UiqU2",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$fg-default",
          "content": "Brief · Descubrir",
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "HLmOb",
          "name": "BB",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "kit-version-source: 1.0.0 · brief-schema: 2\n\n1. PURPOSE\n   The one surface that reads the world instead of the instance: what moved outside your portfolio (D31).\n\n2. ENTRY POINTS\n   - Fourth shell destination, /discover, with Descubrir lit — between Reglas and Ajustes (D31)\n\n3. SCREENS  (left → right)\n   - Olas — Default · Todas las canastas · Sin datos · Calendario agotado\n\n4. BUSINESS RULES\n   - Order: heading, the Alpaca notice when there is no world data, Olas, Titulares, Calendario\n   - Olas ranks 16 baskets by their move over a window from your last visit — at least 7 days, at most 90 — and shows the top five (WarmDiscoverJob)\n   - Every basket is measured against SPY, which is the baseline and not a wave; the difference carries its sign\n   - The exposure chip says \"ya vía <symbol>\" when a referent is held and \"sin exposición\" otherwise, neutral in both (ADR-001)\n   - \"Ver las N canastas\" opens the whole basket in place, grouped, rather than on another screen (D94)\n   - Titulares: up to five headlines filtered to the baskets' symbols\n   - Calendario: the next three Banxico and Fed dates from config/discover_calendar.yml; Fed dates say \"tentativa\"; past its horizon the block says so and links both sources (D33)\n   - What retires the notice is world data, not a credential: a connected Alpaca whose job has not run still shows it\n   - Disposable by contract: no tables, no events, no writes to Asset; the cache is warmed every 4 h with a 24 h TTL, and a visit is logged for the kill criterion (D31)\n\n5. COPY SOURCE\n   config/locales/es-MX.yml — discover.show.*. Basket names and groups: config/discover_baskets.yml. Calendar titles: config/discover_calendar.yml.\n\n6. STATES NOT DRAWN\n   - Olas without Titulares, or Titulares without Olas — the empty block is absent\n   - A basket without a SPY series — no \"vs SPY\" line\n   - The desktop — one column, max-w-3xl; it reflows (D4)\n   - Reportan pronto — dropped (D46)\n\n7. OPEN FINDINGS\n   —  · the job can serve waves up to 24 h old and the screen does not say how old; showing it would be new information, so it needs a D first\n\n8. HISTORY\n   → Log · Descubrir, left of this brief.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
