    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "C0z2r",
      "x": -480,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Log · Descubrir",
      "width": 360,
      "fill": "$bg-surface",
      "cornerRadius": "$radius-card",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12,
      "padding": 20,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "V8QhaG",
          "name": "T",
          "fill": "$fg-default",
          "content": "Log · Descubrir",
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IAU1h",
          "name": "Entry",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-09-16 · Through CHECKLIST.md under D78. Kit 1.0.0; the shell masters back to the kit with Descubrir lit per screen. Olas, Titulares and Calendario mirrored to the code: its order, its copy, WaveRow rebuilt as the row the view renders, the Alpaca notice on primary-muted. The desktop artboard retired — the page reflows. Drawn: Todas las canastas and Calendario agotado. The basket is sixteen waves, not seventeen: SPY is the baseline. Code side: the distance from SPY carries its sign. The \"Dato viejo\" state this brief promised was never built and is now an open finding. Closing pass: the rows read gain_color, a headline's age reads relative_age like the asset detail's news, external links drop the referrer, and Calendario agotado was checked against the rendered page",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "juWaL",
          "name": "Entry",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-08-27 · D41 applied: the Aviso paragraph to fg-default. Measuring it logged D56",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e0a0P",
          "name": "Entry",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-08-27 · D33 closed as the block was built: the calendar YAML declares its horizon, and past it the screen says so",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qhtrJ",
          "name": "Entry",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-08-27 · Reportan pronto dropped (D46): Alpaca serves no earnings calendar",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "GtwRV",
          "name": "Entry",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-08-27 · Re-vendored to kit 0.8.1: TopBar 57 → 76 and TopBarDesktop 76 → 80 for the bell's 44pt target; a TopBarDesktop master seeded from assets.pen corrected",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
